    "chunk_text": "\u00f0 And bisceopas syndon bydelas and Godes lage lareowas, and hi sculan riht bodian and unriht And gif bisceopas forgyma\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hi synna ne styra\u00f0 ne unriht forbeoda\u00fe ne Godes riht ne cy\u00fea\u00f0, ac Be \u00feam spr\u00e6c se witega and grimlice \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0. Hec dicit dominus, Si non adnuntiaueris iniquo iniquitatem suam, sanguinem eius de manu tua Gif \u00feu \u00feam synfullan nelt cw\u00e6\u00f0 ure drihten synna gestyran and unriht forbeoden and \u00f0am manfullan \u00d0is m\u00e6g to heorthoge \u00e6ghwylcum bisceope be\u00feence hine georne be \u00feam, \u00fee he wylle. And se \u00fee nele Godes bodan hyran mid rihte ne godcundre lare gyman, swa he sceolde, he sceall hyran For\u00feam se bi\u00f0 Godes oferhoga, \u00fee Godes bodan oferhoga\u00f0, ealswa Crist sylf on his godspelle swytolice Qui uos audit, me audit et qui uos spernit, me spernit, He cw\u00e6\u00f0, se \u00f0e eow hyre\u00f0 me gehyre\u00f0, and se \u00fee Eala, sw\u00e6r is seo byr\u00f0en, \u00fee Godes bydel beran sceall, gif he nele georne unriht forbeoden. For\u00f0am \u00feeh he sylf tela do and o\u00f0er man misdo, \u00fe\u00e6t him sceall gederian, and gif he nele styran. And \u00feeh Godes bydel misdo, ne beseo man na \u00fe\u00e6rto, ac gyme his lare, gif he tela l\u00e6re, swa swa Crist Que hi dicunt, facite, que autem faciunt, facere nolite, He cw\u00e6\u00f0, fylia\u00f0 heora larum and na heora Ne sceal \u00e6nig man",
